'''Ramon Bernard Harewood''' (born 3 February 1987) is a Barbadian former professional [[American football]] [[offensive tackle]]. He played college football at [[Morehouse College]] in [[Atlanta, Georgia]]. He was selected in the sixth round of the [[2010 NFL draft]], with the Ravens signing him to a three-year contract.<ref>{{cite tweet|user=AaronWilson_NFL|author=Aaron Wilson|number=17270918654|date=28 June 2010|title=The Ravens have agreed to terms on a three-year deal with sixth-round Ramon Harewood that includes a $74,171 signing bonus, per a source.}}</ref>

